otect citizens on every journey.\n\n🚗 Citizen: Explore the map freely in your own vehicle or travel from the transport terminal to any destination.\n\n🌄 Realism and Immersion: Enjoy detailed graphics and an authentic recreation of Antioquia’s roads that will make you feel like you’re right on the road.\n\n🚨 Join now and discover why TransAntioquia is one of the best Colombian experiences!","path":"/game/128317773784581-bus-master","slug":"128317773784581-bus-master","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/10c65e14f989cf90a11573971f274601e135e15fa6c4576752d8b06c32766b95.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-eea9f1ede14214afdc79d1c621e669ff/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":138,"visitor":13908733,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T03:12:06.508Z","creator":{"name":"Blue Nova Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12933818947,"name":"Collapsing Tower","desc":"","path":"/game/12933818947-collapsing-tower","slug":"12933818947-collapsing-tower","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/774481e3e37004bc3ebb067ffe60521529a562c2cc59cd4c23f1eee4609be48a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e86705112e94cf0da85d715ad8f73403/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":137,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":75345901879961,"name":"Survive Cave Dweller","desc":"","path":"/game/75345901879961-survive-cave-dweller","slug":"75345901879961-survive-cave-dweller","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/40dd0a50dc04bae48408e748e1e80f4ac0ab665df86b10ddf226a5709f583c1c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-80cb2b1f9ce31c27412bafbcef44c966/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":137,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":84907238849255,"name":"[X2 CAS